===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[butterfly]] [[fish]]|butterfly fish}}

# any fish of the family [[Chaetodontidae]].
# {{taxlink|Pantodon buchholzi|species}}, a small brown fish of western African streams, often found in aquariums.
# [[butterfly cod]] ({{taxlink|Pterois volitans|species}})
# [[ocellated blenny]] ({{taxlink|Opisthocentrus ocellatus|species}})
# [[flying gurnard]] ({{taxlink|Dactyloptena orientalis|species}})
# {{taxlink|Exocoetus volitans|species}}, a [[flying fish]] of the Atlantic.
# a [[chiton]], a [[mollusc]] of the class [[Polyplacophora]].
# any of several brightly colored fishes

